  "p3_meaning": "P3 fails. With the satellite inside the recording, mode B's jamming-induced error overstates the true front end's by 15.6-30.3 % in this simulation (the mode B model's excess over the true analog's, 1.156-1.303, noise and swept CW at the resolved levels). Its per-sample reconstruction adds within-cell noise that the clean twin (the recording itself) does not share, so it does not cancel: mode B's cancellation share is 0.01-0.14 at those levels, the true analog's 0.19-0.89. For injected ghosts (E2's structure, the exploratory section), both mode B twins requantise reconstruction plus ghost, and mode B's excess understates the truth's by 0.2-7.9 % (0.921-0.998, noise and swept CW at 60 and 70 dB-Hz).",
